# The package holds only what runs: the bundled dist/extension.js, the
# language server in server/, a Java runtime in jre/ for platform packages,
# package.json, language-configuration.json, README and the license files.
# Dependencies are bundled by esbuild, so node_modules is left out too.
**
!package.json
!language-configuration.json
!README.md
!OSMC-License.txt
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!dist/extension.js
!server/crml-language-server.jar
!jre/**
